flowchart TD
  RunningDB[(Running MariaDB and MongoDB)] --> BackupDir[backups/timestamp]
  BackupDir --> MariaDump[mariadb-all-databases.sql.gz]
  BackupDir --> MongoDump[mongodb-all-databases.archive.gz]
  MariaDump --> InitJob[scripts/database-initialize.yaml]
  MongoDump --> InitJob
  InitJob --> RestoreMaria[mysql restore]
  InitJob --> RestoreMongo[mongorestore]
  RestoreMaria --> NewMaria[(Initialized MariaDB)]
  RestoreMongo --> NewMongo[(Initialized MongoDB)]
